From a32d3e42116a8600699114294c66c05f35c03a66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: linuxundich <mail@christoph-langner.de>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:34:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Support WordPress pages and moving posts/pages to the
 trash
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New PostType (post/page) in the frontmatter, written only for pages so
  existing files round-trip unchanged; export, preview, delete and the
  conflict check all target the matching REST collection.
- "Von WordPress öffnen" gets an Artikel/Seiten toggle and a per-row
  "In den Papierkorb" button (recoverable trash, with confirmation).
- "Artikel-Eigenschaften" gains a Typ row; the Kategorien & Tags tab is
  hidden for pages, which have neither taxonomy.
- "Neue Seite" (Ctrl+Alt+N) in the primary menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JjsLyYv6u423JpRrm8ySeT
