From: linuxundich <mail@christoph-langner.de>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:54:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add "KI-Artikel schreiben" and polish the new dialogs

- New aiwriter.rs (Ctrl+Shift+G, primary menu): drafts a whole article
  from a topic/brief with the active KI-Chat provider in three lengths,
  optionally imitating the author's style from their 1-5 most recently
  published posts. The result is reviewed/edited before it becomes a new
  document (title from its # heading) or is inserted at the cursor.
- Media browser: thumbnails as fixed-size Gtk.Image (a Gtk.Picture's
  natural width collapsed the grid to two columns), type icons no longer
  blown up in the details preview, singular "1 Datei angezeigt.".
